/*

Swetha has 
N
 fruits. Sweety asks her to give her a few fruits. Swetha, being very generous and kind-hearted, decides to give all the fruits to Sweety, but with one condition.



She will give all the fruits to Sweety only if the integer 
N
 can be divided into three parts such that these three parts can form the sides of an equilateral triangle. Otherwise, she won't give any fruit to Sweety.



Print YES if Swetha will give all fruits to Sweety; otherwise, print NO

*/

#include<stdio.h>
void main(){ int a;
	scanf("%d",&a);
	if(a%3==0)
		printf("YES");
	else
		printf("NO");
}

